<Base title="Services" current="services" description="Bespoke application development, supported by consultancy in incident management, operational readiness, cloud cost optimisation and observability.">
  <h1>Services</h1>
  <p>The main offer is bespoke software, built with the operational know-how to run it well. The consultancy below supports that work, and each area can also be booked on its own.</p>

  <h2><a href="/services/bespoke-applications/">Bespoke applications</a></h2>
  <p>Customisable tools for the workplace and the home, solving operational challenges or everyday frustrations, and built so the people who use them can maintain them easily.</p>

  <h2>Supporting consultancy</h2>
  <p>The operational expertise behind every build, available alongside the software or as standalone work.</p>

  <h3><a href="/services/incident-management/">Incident management</a></h3>
  <p>Clear response processes, roles and post-incident reviews that turn outages into lasting fixes.</p>

  <h3><a href="/services/operational-readiness/">Operational readiness</a></h3>
  <p>Checking a service can be run safely before launch: runbooks, monitoring, failover, support handover and risk review.</p>

  <h3><a href="/services/cloud-cost-optimisation/">Cloud cost optimisation</a></h3>
  <p>Finding where cloud spend goes, removing waste, and setting up the controls to keep it down.</p>

  <h3><a href="/services/observability/">Observability</a></h3>
  <p>Logs, metrics and traces you can act on, with dashboards and alerts tied to what matters to the business.</p>

  <p><a class="button" href="/contact/">Describe your project</a></p>
</Base>
